{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>現年22歲香港網球選手黃澤林與陳奕迅愛女陳康堤結束半年情後，隨即火速搭上25歲模特兒譚旻萱並傳出同居。男方不僅 …</p><p></p>\n<p>現年22歲香港網球選手黃澤林與陳奕迅愛女陳康堤結束半年情後，隨即火速搭上25歲模特兒譚旻萱並傳出同居。男方不僅被指豪擲5萬月租別墅金屋藏嬌，女方舊愛更發布綠色手掌照片疑似控訴遭到背叛。這段牽涉多人的複雜多角關係背後隱藏着令人咋舌感情內幕。</p>\n<h2>黃澤林陪母購物狂撳手機被揭心不在焉</h2>\n<p>黃澤林被目擊陪同母親現身金鐘大型商場掃貨，期間他雖然主動幫忙提着大袋戰利品，但全程化身低頭族緊盯手機螢幕，手指不斷在鍵盤上飛舞傳送短訊。消息指他早已豪花每月5萬租下西貢一幢2,000呎獨立別墅作為與譚旻萱同居愛巢，兩人上月在澳門觀看籃球賽散場時更被發現登上同一輛七人車，在車廂後座情不自禁深情對望兼溫柔摸面。</p>\n<h2>知情人士大爆譚旻萱拜金綠茶上位情史</h2>\n<p>有知情人士透露黃澤林早於今年8月便與譚旻萱秘密撻着，休賽返港期間屢次以各種荒謬藉口推搪陳康堤約會邀請。另一方面譚旻萱過往情史亦被翻出，友人聲稱她表面直率實質為人好勝拜金，過往與新晉導演舊愛拍拖時便火速進駐對方大坑寓所，如今結識身價不菲新一代體育明星同樣重施故技。女方前任排球教練區顯揚更在社交平台連發三帖，上載染成綠色手掌照片暗示自己慘遭劈腿。</p>\n<h2>網民狠批男方行為不負責任兼心機算盡</h2>\n<p>事件曝光後迅速在各大討論區引發熱烈討論，大批網民對陳康堤遭遇深表同情，留言直斥「公開宣布單身第二日就同新歡去廣州南沙打波，擺明一早搭上」。不少人將矛頭指向女方，狠批「綠茶手段真係高明，次次拍拖都識得搵有錢人包養」。同時亦有網民對陳奕迅當初熱心做媒感到無奈，感嘆「老竇睇錯人搞到個女受傷，真係好心做壞事」。</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179363540228671361_6014454896ae8b44a6ef53.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179363540228671361_6014454896ae8b44a6ef53.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>黃澤林坦承獨自在海外比賽時經常感到孤單，心理上十分需要有人在身邊給予鼓勵。（圖片來源：黃澤林IG）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179363540375952174_9172864476ae8b44be38c5.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179363540375952174_9172864476ae8b44be38c5.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>他特別提到譚旻萱在身邊扮演著重要角色，直言：「我需要佢嘅時候，佢都會喺度」。（圖片來源：譚旻萱IG）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179292968085091343_17621832696addef91398f4.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"黃澤林 譚旻萱 譚旻萱火速撻着黃澤林！（圖片來源：threads）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179292968085091343_17621832696addef91398f4.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>譚旻萱火速撻着黃澤林！（圖片來源：threads）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179317519224680369_7705340376ae1ae988ac3e.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"黃澤林 譚旻萱 （圖片來源：IG@tmh_xd）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179317519224680369_7705340376ae1ae988ac3e.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@tmh_xd）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17936247789957190_3367216036ae88acb2d981.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"黃澤林 譚旻萱 香港網球一哥黃澤林近日飛往首爾出戰ATP挑戰賽，身邊竟然出現人氣女星譚旻萱甜蜜同行。（圖片來源：IG@hambittttt）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17936247789957190_3367216036ae88acb2d981.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>香港網球一哥黃澤林近日飛往首爾出戰ATP挑戰賽，身邊竟然出現人氣女星譚旻萱甜蜜同行。（圖片來源：IG@hambittttt）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/mandytam_20__16720809296999c3026a59d-1024x1280.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"譚旻萱 黃澤林 （圖片來源：《夜王》）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/mandytam_20__16720809296999c3026a59d-1024x1280.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：《夜王》）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e8%ad%9a%e6%97%bb%e8%90%b1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">譚旻萱</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e9%99%b3%e5%ba%b7%e5%a0%a4/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">陳康堤</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e9%bb%83%e6%be%a4%e6%9e%97/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">黃澤林</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3535254\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 3 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T09:24:23.441769+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1241,"images":6,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T07:32:57+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T09:59:15.523868+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T09:20:13.686994+00:00","content_hash":"2f1267fe41bd1cbe81c6754329c43e4f857c54538d7c8f463d71190e60562d08","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}